WEBVTT

00:18.780 --> 00:20.870
<b>The Devil is a Part-Timer! Season 2</b>

01:43.580 --> 01:45.000
Beyond that is...

01:54.920 --> 01:59.840
m 370 218 l 609 218 609 245 370 245

01:56.510 --> 01:59.840
<b>The Hero Questions Her Hometown</b>

01:56.510 --> 01:59.840
<b>The Hero Questions Her Hometown</b>

01:58.900 --> 02:02.390
I've come back to Ente Isla.

02:06.250 --> 02:07.390
Mama?

02:11.110 --> 02:12.900
Welcome home.

02:13.740 --> 02:15.050
Thank you.

02:23.370 --> 02:28.240
Now, here's your hometown 
of Sloane on the map.

02:28.240 --> 02:32.920
And that town's caravan 
should pass close by it!

02:33.480 --> 02:36.420
Use this money, okay?

02:37.700 --> 02:40.930
Um, are we parting ways here, Eme?

02:41.970 --> 02:45.690
The Grand Hoshin Church is in charge 
of reconstruction in the Sloane area

02:45.690 --> 02:49.940
after the damage from the Devil's invasion.

02:50.580 --> 02:53.440
Does that mean Olba's involved?

02:53.740 --> 02:58.060
In Ente Isla, Olba's known as a hero 
of the war against the Devil,

02:58.060 --> 03:00.950
so I think it's possible.

03:00.950 --> 03:06.450
I'm looking into it, but for now 
I think I'd better not get too close.

03:06.930 --> 03:11.960
So I'll quietly pick you up here 
seven days from now.

03:12.610 --> 03:13.650
Got it.

03:13.650 --> 03:15.190
Also...

03:16.510 --> 03:20.470
Here's an angelic quill pen 
that Lailah left behind.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.430
That's Mom's?

03:23.430 --> 03:27.250
Don't you think it's better if you take it?

03:27.250 --> 03:31.380
For one thing, you can use it 
to open a Gate anywhere you want.

03:32.250 --> 03:36.760
No, you keep it. I want all our 
trump cards in separate places.

03:37.170 --> 03:38.760
All right.

03:39.070 --> 03:40.860
Take care, okay?

03:45.370 --> 03:48.370
Bye-bye, Eme-sis!

03:51.750 --> 03:56.750
I swear I'll uncover a clue to Lailah—to Mom.

04:06.240 --> 04:08.840
Next, I go find the caravan...

04:27.940 --> 04:30.790
Wh-What is this?

04:30.790 --> 04:32.920
Mama! Potty!

04:32.920 --> 04:35.290
What? H-Hold it a sec, okay?

04:36.590 --> 04:38.310
Hold it, hold it!

04:40.800 --> 04:42.800
Stinky!

04:43.380 --> 04:46.300
Right, I forgot about this.

04:55.040 --> 04:56.810
It's icky!

04:56.810 --> 04:57.820
What?

05:00.510 --> 05:03.320
I d-don't remember it tasting like this.

05:03.640 --> 05:04.740
Don't want it!

05:04.740 --> 05:07.790
I'm s-sorry. But you need to eat.

05:07.790 --> 05:09.660
Mama will eat it too, okay?

05:09.660 --> 05:11.180
No!

05:11.180 --> 05:13.830
Yeah, Japan's vegetables tasted good...

05:13.830 --> 05:17.830
Don't wanna eat it! Don't want it!

05:24.970 --> 05:28.580
I miss convenience stores so much.

05:37.890 --> 05:40.730
That's Sloane Village...

06:02.970 --> 06:06.510
This is Dad's wheat?

06:07.180 --> 06:08.510
Mama?

06:11.930 --> 06:15.000
It's... It's alive.

06:16.330 --> 06:20.780
Dad's wheat is still alive!

06:21.710 --> 06:23.040
Mama?

06:25.270 --> 06:27.540
Mama, why—

06:27.540 --> 06:32.090
Alas Ramus, I can keep trying! And I have to!

06:32.090 --> 06:32.940
Mama?

06:32.940 --> 06:35.680
Dad might really be alive, too!

06:36.290 --> 06:38.460
Oh, hey—the house.

06:42.110 --> 06:45.800
Here it is. The house Dad and I lived in.

06:46.650 --> 06:49.930
There might be clues about him and Mom here.

06:58.050 --> 06:59.940
There's nothing here.

07:03.550 --> 07:07.440
I thought there might be 
some kind of hint, but...

07:07.440 --> 07:09.820
Mama, I'm hungry!

07:10.980 --> 07:13.570
Me, too. Shall we have dinner?

07:16.890 --> 07:17.580
Ow, hot!

07:18.580 --> 07:20.080
'urry!

07:22.900 --> 07:24.590
It's yummy!

07:27.000 --> 07:31.720
I didn't expect to use the Japanese 
food I brought so soon...

07:32.130 --> 07:37.550
So, Alas Ramus, do you sense 
any shards of Yesod around here?

07:37.550 --> 07:38.680
Nope!

07:38.990 --> 07:40.370
Right...

07:44.230 --> 07:46.820
Looks like I won't find anything here.

07:48.880 --> 07:50.740
Huh, what's this?

07:51.940 --> 07:56.050
"License to Cultivate New Land"?

07:56.050 --> 07:57.120
Cultivate?

08:05.140 --> 08:08.630
Nobody could follow such a badly drawn map.

08:12.130 --> 08:13.880
<b>Northwest</b>

08:13.880 --> 08:15.640
<b>September 8 (Thursday)</b>

08:18.050 --> 08:21.520
I'll be back no later than the 12th.

08:22.580 --> 08:24.610
I have to keep my promise.

08:27.710 --> 08:30.130
Alas Ramus? What's wrong?

08:30.130 --> 08:31.480
This way!

08:34.280 --> 08:36.530
W-Wait! Alas Ramus?!

08:40.710 --> 08:42.410
There's a barrier field here?

08:43.060 --> 08:44.230
Mama!

08:44.230 --> 08:45.420
Alas Ramus?

08:48.710 --> 08:51.820
Alas Ramus, what is this place?

08:52.330 --> 08:54.550
Your house. Right?

08:54.550 --> 08:56.550
It smells like Mama!

08:59.760 --> 09:04.560
Listen, Alas Ramus... 
what's your mama's name?

09:06.470 --> 09:07.560
Lailah!

09:09.570 --> 09:15.570
<i>Alas Ramus has been seeing Lailah in me?</i>

09:16.210 --> 09:18.570
We're not going inside?

09:21.040 --> 09:24.310
Mom saved the Devil when he was young,

09:24.310 --> 09:27.650
then entrusted him 
with a shard of Yesod.

09:28.190 --> 09:30.780
Alas Ramus was born from that...

09:32.420 --> 09:33.820
Why?

09:34.550 --> 09:38.120
Why did you save the <i>Devil</i>, Mom?

09:38.590 --> 09:39.920
Mama?

09:46.140 --> 09:50.430
Mom spread the broken bits of Yesod all over.

09:50.430 --> 09:52.880
Is she trying to put them back together now?

09:53.330 --> 09:55.360
And Dad knew that?

09:56.910 --> 09:59.140
Hey, Alas Ramus—

10:00.900 --> 10:04.040
Acieth! Acieth!

10:08.770 --> 10:11.710
Mama, where's Acieth?!

10:11.710 --> 10:15.630
Acieth's gone! Acieth's gone!

10:13.630 --> 10:15.630
C-Calm down!

10:16.320 --> 10:21.140
Do you mean Acieth Alla?

10:22.550 --> 10:25.910
No! Don't do that, or Olba will find us!

10:28.020 --> 10:31.700
Acieth!

10:31.700 --> 10:33.020
Oh, no!

10:45.040 --> 10:47.200
Olba and Raguel!

10:48.270 --> 10:50.680
It's been a while, Emilia.

10:50.680 --> 10:56.060
I apologize for the suddenness, 
but I came to invite you to Efzahan.

10:56.550 --> 10:59.550
Efzahan? What do you plan to do there?

10:59.550 --> 11:05.640
Emilia, I believe these gentlemen 
told you that your father is alive.

11:06.550 --> 11:10.560
He should be in the Heavenly 
Regiment's custody right about now.

11:13.970 --> 11:17.740
Olba, you're even worse than I thought.

11:27.470 --> 11:31.200
What should I do?

11:34.580 --> 11:37.210
That's it for Kawa-cchi and Kato-rin.

11:37.650 --> 11:40.010
Who else might cover a shift for me?

11:40.010 --> 11:43.980
Maou! Maou! Let's hurry and go find Big Sis!

11:43.980 --> 11:48.470
You meanie! You slowpoke! You dummy!

11:48.470 --> 11:50.400
Shut up!

11:51.000 --> 11:52.330
M-Mr. Maou?

11:52.330 --> 11:54.970
I heard a shout. What's wrong?

11:54.970 --> 11:58.480
Maou! Chiho has ice cream! Gimme some!

11:59.350 --> 12:00.540
Ice cream!

12:00.540 --> 12:02.360
Whoa! Acieth?!

12:02.360 --> 12:04.990
Acieth! Don't shock our guests!

12:05.650 --> 12:09.010
Maou, keep it down. 
The noise makes me hurt more.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.400
That was good!

12:15.400 --> 12:18.610
Maou, I'm going back inside 
to take a post-meal nap.

12:18.610 --> 12:21.010
A-A-Acieth, what are you doing?!

12:21.010 --> 12:24.020
What the hell, Acieth? Get away from me!

12:24.020 --> 12:26.730
Aw, Maou, you're so shy.

12:26.730 --> 12:31.130
Acieth! You're making 
Mr. Maou uncomfortable, so stop it!

12:31.130 --> 12:32.970
Or I'll never buy you more ice cream!

12:32.970 --> 12:34.520
O-Okay!

12:35.070 --> 12:38.530
And Mr. Maou, you need 
to stop spoiling Acieth,

12:38.530 --> 12:42.720
or Alas Ramus will be jealous 
and hate you when she gets back!

12:42.720 --> 12:44.890
I said keep it down.

12:45.910 --> 12:48.330
Can we get down to business now?

12:48.330 --> 12:49.280
S-Sure.

12:50.910 --> 12:54.130
I had Chiho tell me everything.

12:54.130 --> 12:58.790
I know about Emi, and Mr. Ashiya, 
and... Ente Isla?

12:59.170 --> 13:01.830
Who'd've thought you were the Devil?

13:01.830 --> 13:04.300
You're pretty brave, huh?

13:04.650 --> 13:07.380
I just hid in bed for two days, actually.

13:07.770 --> 13:09.970
But I've made up my mind:

13:09.970 --> 13:12.990
I'll accept Emi and Mr. Ashiya 
no matter who they are,

13:12.990 --> 13:14.810
and I want to do what I can.

13:14.810 --> 13:17.310
I don't want my memories erased, okay?

13:17.970 --> 13:21.350
I see. They have a good friend in you.

13:23.590 --> 13:26.070
May I have a moment, Satan?

13:26.860 --> 13:27.560
Wha...

13:27.910 --> 13:30.080
What the heck?

13:30.080 --> 13:32.430
What are these doing here?

13:32.430 --> 13:36.180
Suzuno and I drove them here together.

13:36.180 --> 13:38.580
<i>Drove</i>? But you need a license.

13:39.500 --> 13:41.590
Check it out. I got one!

13:41.590 --> 13:44.090
S-S-S-Say what?!

13:44.090 --> 13:47.950
You beat me to it? Is this a veiled insult?!

13:47.950 --> 13:51.530
What was the alternative? 
We're about to go to Ente Isla.

13:51.530 --> 13:54.810
Do you intend to walk around 
with no transportation?

13:54.810 --> 13:57.230
We need to bring provisions,

13:57.230 --> 14:01.420
and more importantly, people as powerful 
as we are flying through the air

14:01.420 --> 14:03.780
would get detected immediately.

14:03.780 --> 14:06.740
B-But I don't have a license yet...

14:06.740 --> 14:10.740
You don't need a moped license 
to drive a scooter in Ente Isla.

14:12.110 --> 14:14.730
How much did two scooters cost, exactly?!

14:15.240 --> 14:18.320
They're used, so about
500,000 yen, all told.

14:18.320 --> 14:20.040
F-Five hundred?!

14:21.710 --> 14:23.750
Five hundred thousand...

14:24.750 --> 14:27.490
So is Emi okay?

14:28.250 --> 14:32.760
If you're asking whether Emi might 
be injured or in physical danger,

14:32.760 --> 14:35.130
you don't need to worry.

14:35.130 --> 14:36.050
What?

14:36.050 --> 14:41.980
Believe it or not, when Emilia is in 
Ente Isla, guns and knives are nothing.

14:41.980 --> 14:45.640
You could fire at her from behind with 
a tank and it wouldn't scratch her.

14:45.640 --> 14:46.800
This ain't manga!

14:46.800 --> 14:49.470
In fact, given Emi's strength,

14:49.470 --> 14:51.780
it worries me that she 
hasn't come back.

14:55.290 --> 14:58.780
Mr. Maou, I'm so happy.

14:59.180 --> 15:01.290
You really are kind.

15:02.060 --> 15:03.790
Wh-What?

15:03.790 --> 15:07.800
He's as dense as ever. Ah, youth!

15:09.340 --> 15:12.800
A-Anyway, if something's slowing Emi down,

15:12.800 --> 15:16.810
I'm guessing it's because her hands 
are tied by compassion or something.

15:17.190 --> 15:19.850
So if Emi's having trouble,

15:19.850 --> 15:22.440
she's probably in the eastern 
continent, in Efzahan.

15:22.770 --> 15:26.650
It's home base for all the Malebranche 
that Olba instigated.

15:26.650 --> 15:29.850
That doesn't seem like much 
basis for your conclusion.

15:29.850 --> 15:31.520
Oh, I have more basis.

15:31.520 --> 15:32.320
Urushihara!

15:33.840 --> 15:37.700
Seriously, don't ask the injured guy 
to search for stuff like this.

15:37.700 --> 15:40.500
You wouldn't need to search 
if you kept your stuff organized.

15:41.350 --> 15:43.300
I called Gabriel and asked him.

15:43.300 --> 15:45.340
Angels have mobile phones?!

15:45.340 --> 15:50.540
Yeah. And thanks to that goon 
leaving this with Urushihara,

15:50.540 --> 15:54.090
we confirmed that Ashiya, Emi, 
Alas Ramus, and Emi's dad

15:54.090 --> 15:56.350
are all in Efzahan.

15:56.350 --> 15:59.040
He could be faking us out.

15:59.040 --> 16:03.030
That's why I'm leaving you 
here in Japan, just in case.

16:03.720 --> 16:07.110
If I'm gonna do something, 
it'll be after I'm healed.

16:07.110 --> 16:09.230
You're sure he shouldn't go?

16:09.230 --> 16:12.480
It's more accurate to say 
that we can't bring him.

16:12.480 --> 16:17.400
The more people going through the 
Gate, the more celestial force used.

16:17.400 --> 16:20.790
My calculations say I'll have 
barely enough for two.

16:20.790 --> 16:23.750
No worries, Ms. Amane 
can help in an emergency.

16:23.750 --> 16:25.750
I saw that coming.

16:26.540 --> 16:30.260
Are you ready to finally 
tell us why you're visiting?

16:30.260 --> 16:32.680
What does it matter why?

16:33.260 --> 16:35.880
But to thank you for the shelter and food,

16:35.880 --> 16:39.640
I'll protect Chiho and Rika 
if something happens.

16:39.640 --> 16:43.920
Efzahan is quite large, though. 
Where will we start?

16:43.920 --> 16:45.750
That's a given.

16:46.480 --> 16:49.500
We'll find them where 
Emilia couldn't conquer us:

16:50.290 --> 16:52.150
Heavensky Keep.

17:01.010 --> 17:03.680
I told them to wait at the apartment.

17:03.680 --> 17:06.350
They want to see you off.

17:06.350 --> 17:09.410
Are you going away for a while, Maa?

17:09.410 --> 17:10.050
Huh?

17:10.050 --> 17:12.420
You rarely ask 
for time off on short notice,

17:12.420 --> 17:14.380
let alone give up so many shifts.

17:14.850 --> 17:17.050
Plus, Chi seems on edge.

17:17.050 --> 17:21.060
Y-You're right. 
I'm sorry for causing trouble.

17:21.540 --> 17:23.310
It's no trouble.

17:23.310 --> 17:26.460
Just don't get injured 
or sick while you're away.

17:28.040 --> 17:31.480
Otherwise I might lose another 
member of my fighting forces.

17:33.780 --> 17:35.070
I'll keep that in mind.

17:35.450 --> 17:37.180
Chiho, over here!

17:38.090 --> 17:41.650
Is your manager someone really powerful?

17:41.650 --> 17:45.050
Maou's the Devil, but he's 
voluntarily obeying her.

17:45.050 --> 17:48.080
She's a normal Japanese person, like us.

17:48.840 --> 17:51.220
But she's a boss we can respect.

17:52.250 --> 17:56.860
She pays attention to people, 
learns what they're good and bad at,

17:56.860 --> 18:00.520
and makes sure to acknowledge and 
praise us when we do our jobs well.

18:00.520 --> 18:06.100
I think because Mr. Maou was the Devil, 
a really strong king with lots of power,

18:06.100 --> 18:11.860
he realized how little he could do 
on his own once he became human.

18:12.770 --> 18:16.090
I am back again tonight, my goddess!

18:16.090 --> 18:20.120
Whoops, I mean, Manager Kisaki!

18:20.120 --> 18:21.770
I am here once again!

18:21.770 --> 18:24.620
It is I, Sarue!

18:26.590 --> 18:27.620
Acieth!

18:33.050 --> 18:34.830
What's wrong, Maa?

18:34.830 --> 18:37.130
Oh, um, nothing.

18:37.130 --> 18:38.960
What's wrong, Sarue?

18:40.210 --> 18:46.100
I apologize, Manager Kisaki, but may 
I ask you to make my order to go?

18:52.650 --> 18:56.000
Wh-What got into Acieth?

18:56.000 --> 18:57.260
Maou! Lemme out!

18:57.260 --> 18:58.650
Oh, shut up!

18:58.650 --> 19:02.110
I'm not sure exactly, 
but Acieth and Alas Ramus

19:02.110 --> 19:03.760
both have an extreme anti-angel thing going.

19:03.760 --> 19:05.660
Lemme out, damn you!

19:08.180 --> 19:12.030
Is that the baby who 
reportedly fused with Emilia?

19:12.030 --> 19:15.170
They're the same being, 
but apparently different people.

19:15.170 --> 19:18.130
Then what is she? She seemed like a shard.

19:18.600 --> 19:21.680
I don't know anything about 
how the sephiroth are handled.

19:22.170 --> 19:26.180
I left Heaven before you guys 
started doing that stuff.

19:26.850 --> 19:30.820
S-Suzuno, that guy wearing the SFC uniform...

19:30.820 --> 19:35.190
Ah, yes. That's the archangel Sariel. 
He's from Ente Isla's Heaven.

19:35.190 --> 19:37.690
He's with that Gabriel guy?!

19:38.550 --> 19:41.260
What has Gabriel done?

19:41.260 --> 19:43.200
I assumed you knew.

19:43.570 --> 19:47.640
He did bring an army to 
try to drag me back home,

19:48.100 --> 19:51.110
but when I threatened him with 
Gaze of the Fall, he left without a fight.

19:51.110 --> 19:53.710
He has some nerve to 
obstruct business like that!

19:53.710 --> 19:57.180
Sariel, are you turning into Maou?

19:57.620 --> 20:00.220
After I began working in this neighborhood,

20:00.220 --> 20:02.910
I met my goddess Mayumi Kisaki,

20:02.910 --> 20:06.780
and for the first time, I used my power 
for someone other than myself.

20:06.780 --> 20:10.120
It was a new experience, 
but not an unpleasant one.

20:10.610 --> 20:12.450
I don't want to go back to a world

20:12.450 --> 20:15.320
where Heaven's safety is 
prioritized above all else.

20:15.740 --> 20:20.740
The man I am now is only interested in how 
I can live my life along with her!

20:20.740 --> 20:22.800
You're a generic creep.

20:23.370 --> 20:26.290
Thus, whatever you lot choose to do,

20:26.290 --> 20:29.120
I do not intend to either help or hinder you!

20:29.120 --> 20:33.750
I shall only pursue my future 
with Mayumi Kisaki!

20:34.390 --> 20:38.460
It'd suck for you if Acieth 
or Alas Ramus killed you first.

20:39.460 --> 20:42.760
What the hell did you guys 
do to the sephiroth?

20:42.760 --> 20:47.740
I wasn't in a position to do 
anything to the Tree of Life directly,

20:48.450 --> 20:53.540
but I can tell you what Heaven's motive 
was for messing with the Tree.

20:56.140 --> 21:00.820
They were trying to prevent a true 
God from being born in Ente Isla.

21:01.780 --> 21:05.060
They sure came up with a stupid idea.

21:08.730 --> 21:11.810
A-Are we okay? Does anyone see us?

21:11.810 --> 21:14.800
I'm not sure I believe you ruled over demons!

21:14.800 --> 21:17.310
We're trespassing! Of course I'm worried!

21:28.800 --> 21:32.310
Divine souls who maintain life and time,

21:32.310 --> 21:36.810
discover this world beyond the stars!

21:50.280 --> 21:51.450
The Gate...

21:57.960 --> 21:59.270
Let's go, Satan.

21:59.270 --> 22:00.450
R-Right!

22:01.210 --> 22:02.460
Mr. Maou...

22:02.000 --> 22:09.070

